# Build-context exclusions — the images need manifests + source only
# (docker build still resolves everything; this keeps the context small
# and prevents host artifacts leaking into image layers).
.git
.venv
.tmp
.rsm-store
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
node_modules
**/node_modules
frontend/web/.next
frontend/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo
store
tests
**/tests
docs
.aflow
.github
*.zip
*.vsix
*.log